              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bhakamenya kömöndaara go Goseni, gönsë ya Misiri; bhakaibhörana bhakanyoora ibhintö ibhiaru ho, bhakaamëhëra ho, bhaikabhörana na kuiyengeria bhökong'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
